NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE

1. MARKET DATA. This package contains no market data, reads no files and makes
   no network calls, and the licence above grants no rights over any market
   data whatsoever. The statutory and broker-published rate schedules written
   into `equity_cost_model.py` are cited facts, not a dataset. Anyone using
   this package against Indian exchange data remains subject to the
   publishers' own terms, which prohibit redistribution:

       NSE, Website Policies        https://www.nseindia.com/website-policies
       NSE Indices, Terms of Use    https://www.niftyindices.com/terms-of-use

   Fetching that data for your own use is between you and them. Nothing here
   permits you to republish it.

2. NO INVESTMENT ADVICE, AND THE COST MODEL IS NOT AUTHORITATIVE. The rate
   eras in `equity_cost_model.py` are sourced to broker-published schedules
   rather than statutory gazettes, and each carries `verified=False` unless
   stated otherwise in the source. `rate_on()` raises rather than guessing
   outside its sourced range, which is deliberate, but it is not a substitute
   for checking the current schedule yourself. Nothing here is advice or a
   recommendation.
